# The frozen ShapeComp audit records (d5b/d6/cp8 provenance blocks in
# experiments/shape_perception_benchmark) pin the exact bytes they verified,
# and those bytes are the CRLF presentation produced on the authoring machine.
# Without this rule an LF checkout (Linux/macOS default) hashes differently and
# the audit-verification tests fail even though the blobs are unchanged. Pin the
# presentation on every platform; blobs stay LF-normalized in git.
experiments/shape_perception_benchmark/** text=auto eol=crlf
